+/**
+ * 虚拟屏 in a window of its own — the background display, live, without covering the phone.
+ *
+ * Three shapes, like the call card's two: a 12×56 dp sliver at an edge, a small window with the
+ * picture, and an expanded window that adds every key (← speaker eye, ×, − ＋ ↺ ⇄). A drag that
+ * ends at an edge — or is flung at one — parks it as the sliver; a tap brings it back one shape.
+ *
+ * 手势挂在本窗口最外层容器（box）、用 raw 坐标：SMALL 和 EXPAND 都能拖、都能甩边贴边（第二十一
+ * 节 2）；画面内容层不接手势。窗口按虚拟屏的宽高比开（第二十四节 6），画面铺满不留黑边；−/＋
+ * 缩放的是整个窗口（倍率 0.6–2.0，记住上次值），不是裁剪内部画面。
+ *
+ * The picture is the display itself: the SurfaceView's surface is handed to the privileged engine
+ * that owns the VirtualDisplay (`setSurface`), so there is no JPEG on the way. When that is not
+ * available (an adb-stream transport cannot carry a Surface) the same window shows the preview
+ * frames it has always had, so nothing goes black.
+ *
+ * 按键全部用 App 自己的图标字体（第十八节）：单色、alpha 0.85（按下 1.0）、圆形半透明底、
