+/// 唤醒触发的通话: a counter the open conversation watches (ui/chat/chat_screen.dart).
+///
+/// A wake word does not know which conversation is on screen, and the call page needs one, so the
+/// chime fires this and the screen that owns a conversation answers with its call.
+final wakeCallRequestProvider = NotifierProvider<WakeCallRequest, int>(WakeCallRequest.new);
+
+/// The request the screen has already answered, so a request made while no conversation was
+/// on screen is still answered when one comes up: without it a wake word that matched while
+/// the app was backgrounded only brought the activity forward and opened nothing.
+final wakeCallHandledProvider = NotifierProvider<WakeCallHandled, int>(WakeCallHandled.new);
